<title>USA: Thermo Fibertek sets $20 mln share buyback.</title>
<headline>Thermo Fibertek sets $20 mln share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Fibertek Inc said Monday its board had authorized buying back up to $20 million of its shares through July 18, 1998.</p>
<p>The company said it will repurchase the shares in the open market or in negotiated transactions at prices it &quot;considers attractive.&quot;  </p>
<p>A Thermo spokeswoman said the company had about 64 million shares outstanding as of March 29.</p>
<p>The stock was down 3/8 at 10-1/16 in Monday morning trade.</p>
</text>
